{
  "id": "JDG.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Ŋikat. 20",
  "verseCount": 48,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitijikis ŋituŋa a ŋikabilae a ŋuluce ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Ŋisirael daadaŋ ameun alo Dan tari Bee-Seba akitodol Gilead, tocunakin daadaŋ kiŋaren Ekapolon nakibois apei alo Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi natukot ŋin ŋikarikok daadaŋ a ŋikabilae a ŋituŋa a Isirael ka ayakasi nen ŋasigarya ŋuna alosete a ŋakejen ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaomwon ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kiirasi ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin atemar etipeiyosi Ŋisirael daadaŋ Misipa.) Kiŋita nai Ŋisirael Elepait temasi, “Tolimokinae isua epite ŋolo etiyakinotor ŋakiro ŋuna aronok nu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok nai Elepait ŋolo aponi toarae aberu keŋ, Ŋisirael tema, “Abu ayoŋ odolu Gibea lotaun ŋolo a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, aŋuna ka akiper nen, ikirukit ayoŋ ka aberu kaŋ ŋina pa eisitae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodi apotu ŋituŋa a Gibea potu neni kaŋ nakwaare kirikaut akai ecamito ikes akiar ayoŋ, apotu nai ikes, torata aberu kaŋ tari ŋina atwania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ayoŋ olemu akuwan a aberu kaŋ otubutubu, ido eyakiya ŋatubutubeta ŋun nakwap a ŋituŋa a Isirael daadaŋ, anerae etiyata ikes akapil alo Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tokona iyes Ŋisirael daadaŋ, tolimutu ŋakiro ŋuna itamete iyes atemar iyookino ka ŋuna erae kitiyae aŋuna a ŋakiro a ŋun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyout ŋituŋa daadaŋ ecamuna temasi, “Nyikilosi isua daadaŋ loeemae kosi, mam tari ipei daŋ alokidiŋ kosi ŋini eboŋori kai keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋuna elosyo isua akitiya neni a ŋituŋa a Gibea, ikes nu: Ilamilamyo isua toyenunae ŋituŋa ŋulu alosete akitijikin ŋituŋa a Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋituŋa amiat earyo ŋituŋa ŋitomon alokabilae a daadaŋ a ŋulu a Ŋisirael, eseunio alotooma ŋituŋa aliput earyo ŋituŋa amiat ka alotooma ŋalipyo ŋatomon earyo ŋituŋa aliput, aŋuna ka akiwok akimuj a ŋasigarya a ŋuna elosete akinyaŋar ŋakiro a ŋituŋa a Gibea a etaun a ŋolo a Benjamin, ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ka akapil a ŋina apotu ikes kitiyata alo Isirael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋikilyok daadaŋ alo Isirael kimorikinos aŋuna ka akitijiore ŋituŋa a etaun Gibea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiyasi ŋituŋa a ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael a daadaŋ ŋituŋa lokabila a ŋituŋa a Benjamin temasi, “Anironis ŋin ŋina keponi kitiyae alokidiŋ kus? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, yautu tokona ŋikesyaak ŋulu a Gibea, ikotere toarae isua ikes, tolemarere aronis alo Isirael.” Nai apotu ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin nyecamut ŋakiro ŋuna a ŋiyeneta kec a Ŋisirael a ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocunakinos ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin alotaunio a daadaŋ Gibea, alosit akitijiore Ŋisirael ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, apotu ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin tocunut alotaunio kec ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋakanikapei ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie, pa imaritae ŋikilyok ŋulu ke etaun Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋikilyok ŋul, ayakasi ŋikilyok ŋamiae ŋakanikaarei ŋulu aseunitae ŋulu akedyenyaka, apedori ŋinituŋanan a ŋikilyok a ŋul akimasar amoru a adoe emam akidyak ibore ŋini etya etimat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocunakis Ŋisirael ŋuluce, pa imaritae ŋulu a ekabila a Benjamin, ŋikajiok ŋalipyo ŋamiae ŋaomwon ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulujiet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto Ŋisirael kiŋaren kitipeiyosi Besel neni eŋituniata ikes ŋakiro aneni ka Akuj ebasi, “Ŋae alokidiŋ kosi itipeiyori ekiŋaren akitijikin ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin?” Toboŋok Ekapolon tema, “Ŋituŋa ekabila a Yuda ikes itipeiyorete ekiŋaren.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torotokis nai Ŋisirael taparacu sek kiboiyosi diyete Gibea aŋuna ka akitijikin ŋituŋa keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto Ŋisirael akitijikin ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, kicodosi Ŋisirael akirem ikes alo Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolomut ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin alo Gibea toara akoloŋit ŋin Ŋisirael ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totitinyokieta Ŋisirael toboŋo, kicodosi nabo anakibois a ŋinapei ecodoritotor akoloŋit ŋina a ekiŋaren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitipeiyosi Ŋisirael, kigworo neni ke Ekapolon apaaran daadaŋ akitodol eboŋ, kiŋita nabo ikes Ekapolon ŋakiro temasi, “Elosyo ba nabo isua diyete akicodor akitijikin ŋiyeneta kosi ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin a?” Toboŋok Ekapolon ikes tema, “Toloto kitijikisi ikes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Ŋisirael toloto akitijikin ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin akitijikinet ŋina a ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolomut ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin alo Gibea akitijikin Ŋisirael akitijikinet ŋina a ŋaarei, toara ikes apaki ŋin Ŋisirael ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋakanikauni, ŋikilyok ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto nabo Ŋisirael daadaŋ Besel kigworo neni ke Ekapolon iboiyete a nen, kiredakis akiron akoloŋit ŋin akitodol eboŋ. Inanakis nai alo kiŋaren Ekapolon ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ka ŋamuronisya ŋuna ke ekisil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋita nabo Ŋisirael aneni ke Ekapolon ŋuna emaikina kitiyata (anerae alorwa a ŋul, ayai nen Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ŋina ka Akuj, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido arae Pineas lokoku ke Eleasar a ŋolo erae lokoku ka Aron iŋes etiyae etic ŋolo ka akidarit Asaduku alorwa a ŋul), kiŋita nai Ŋisirael Ekapolon temasi, “Elosyo ba isua nabo akitijiore ŋiyeneta kosi ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, kori imyekinio?” Toboŋok Ekapolon ikes tema, “Apesi, kitijikis ikes, anerae moi taparacu epotokini ayoŋ ikes napedor kus.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kiwuakis Ŋisirael ŋikilyok ŋulu irimokinito etaun Gibea kidiŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitipeiyosi nai Ŋisirael akitijikin ŋituŋa ekabila a Benjamin epete ŋirwa ŋiuni, kicodosi nabo akitijikin ŋituŋa a Gibea, lopite ŋolo ecodoritotor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elomunete ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin akitijikin ajore a Ŋisirael, apotu Ŋisirael kitataiyasi ikes alotaun. Togeikis nabo ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin akiar ŋasigarya a Ŋisirael, lopite ŋolopei sek a ŋijiesyo a ŋulu a ekiŋaren. Toara ikes Ŋisirael alorotin a ŋulu apolok, epei a ŋirotin a ŋul iŋes erot ŋolo elosere Besel, ŋoloce iŋes ŋolo elosere Gibea, toara daŋ ikes Ŋisirael anariet toara daŋ Ŋisirael ŋulu aapikinit ekimar kec ŋatomoniuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamakis ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin ebe, “Eloun iwon ikes nabo, lopite ŋolo elounitere ekiŋaren.” Nai abasi ikes Ŋisirael, “Oboŋosi etatasi ikes tolwakyata alotaun todolo lorotin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋosi Ŋisirael ŋulu alalak aneni ayai ejie todolo Baal-Tamar, apaki ŋin toporut Ŋisirael ŋulu sek aurumikinito etaun Gibea alo To. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toloto nai ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomon ŋulu aseunitae alotuŋa a Ŋisirael daadaŋ akitijikin ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin alo Gibea. Tomwanu ejie nooi nyeyenut ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin atemar aapuu amunyar ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilou Ekapolon ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin alokiŋaren Ŋisirael, toara Ŋisirael ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin akoloŋit ŋin ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋakan ka amiat, arae ŋulu aaryo daadaŋ ŋikilyok ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toanyut nai ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin atemar eloun ikes alojie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋasigarya a Ŋisirael ŋuna alalak toboŋosi kaku aneni a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, anerae ekinyomito ikes ŋikilyok ŋulu aurumikinito etaun Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toporut ŋasigarya ŋuna aurumikinito etaun Gibea, tolomasi atipei lotaun, toara a ekileŋ ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ayakasi lotaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erworiunito sek ŋasigarya a Ŋisirael ŋuna alwaka alotaun ka ŋuna aurumikinito etaun atemar ani itupuruunete ŋulu eyakasi tooma etaun akim alotaun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina ŋasigarya ŋuna alwaka alotaun toboŋo kitijikis ŋimoe. Nai aris ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin kegeikis akiar Ŋisirael, toara ikes Ŋisirael ŋatomoniuni. Aŋun apotu ikes totamakis ebe, “Eloun iwon ikes nabo lopite ŋolopei koloŋit elounitere alojie a ŋolo a ekiŋaren.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eremi apuru kidiama esibit edou alotaun, kiŋoliyasi ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin kaku, kiŋolikis etaun daadaŋ epurui eremit apuru kidiama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibeleun nai ajore a Ŋisirael ŋina alalan ŋina sek etataiyarit ŋimoe, tobul ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, anerae apotu ikes toanyut atemar apuu amunyar ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ikes toema aneni a Ŋisirael kitoro lowae ŋolo a aloŋisat, nai toditasi ŋikajiok a Ŋisirael ikes, toara Ŋisirael ŋulu sek aya lotaun a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin ŋulu aya kidiŋ ŋajorei kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuapa Ŋisirael ŋituŋa a Benjamin, toara ageun alo Noa akitodol nakibois ŋina ayai kide Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toarae ŋasigarya a ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin ŋalipyo ŋatomon ka ŋakanikauni, arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋikajiok ŋulu atitinyok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ebwaŋasi ikes eemete lowae ŋolo ka aloŋisat, nataaba ŋina a Rimon, toara Ŋisirael ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin ŋalipyo ŋakan a lorotin a ŋulu apolok, kiritae ikes akitodol Gidom, toarae nabo a nen ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, daadaŋ ŋulu aponi toarae akoloŋit ŋin alotuŋa a Benjamin arae ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaarei ŋikilyok ŋulu ayakatar ŋiboro ŋulu ke ejie ka arae daadaŋ ŋikajiok ŋulu adedeŋak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋikilyok ŋamiae ŋakanikapei toema lowae ŋolo a aloŋisat, nataaba ŋina a Rimon, kiboiyoto a nen ŋilapyo ŋiomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, toboŋosi Ŋisirael neni aya ŋituŋa a ekabila a Benjamin, toara a ekileŋ ŋituŋa ŋulu eboiyete alotaun, ŋibaren ka ibore daadaŋ ŋini edoŋit, kicunyakis tari ŋitaunio ŋulu ariŋa nyicunya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
